{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited a store\u2026 but along with it comes what lurks within its walls.<br>In <i>Last Shift</i>, you arrive to see the old shop for the very first time. It stands far beyond the city, surrounded by silence and emptiness. It seems like an ordinary place\u2026 until the lights start to flicker and the aisles twist into something out of a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere of night terror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creaking floors, sudden noises, distorted space, and unexpected jump scares will make you feel like someone is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark aisles, search for keys and codes, solve simple puzzles, and keep moving forward. Everything around you works against you: the light, the sound, and the atmosphere itself turn every step into a trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror focused on jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A store gradually transforming into a terrifying space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles and item searching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: 1\u20132 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players looking for a short yet intense horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive your first night in this store\u2026 and make it out alive?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086770?t=1760625915","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086770/574aa95ebe37518844c9eebe42d7ad43d4bc7052/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760625915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086770/1f6cce4f66522b6213696a1abf24645e780e2515/capsule_231x87.jp